From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:51:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D217 server: a shell command that cannot start is a typed
 error

Upstream: POST /api/shell turns every start failure into a defect, so a command the system refuses to start answers
500 with an empty body.
Fixed: failures caused by the request answer 400 InvalidRequestError in the D204 shape: a NUL character in the
command (kind invalid_command, field command), a command longer than the system can pass to the shell (E2BIG; kind
invalid_command), and a working directory the server may not enter (EACCES; kind invalid_cwd, "cwd is not
accessible: <cwd>"). Any other start failure is logged and answers 500 UnknownError with a log reference, like the
other host failures. A missing configured shell is not reachable: shell selection falls back to the default shell.
Scenarios: shell-api.test.ts "shell routes for unknown commands" (the three requests added by D216; the
permission case needs a non-root server)
Upstream tests: packages/server/test/shell.test.ts adds a test; client and openapi.json regenerated

